📥 Input:
String input1;
String input2;
⚙️ Requirements:
• Convert input1 into a whole number using a wrapper-class conversion method
• Convert input2 into a decimal number using a wrapper-class conversion method
• Calculate the sum of the two numbers as double
• Print: "Sum: <sum>"</sum>
📌 Constraints:
• Use only standard Java
• Output must match the required format exactly
📤 Output format:
Sum: <sum>
📌 Test cases:
